stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Closed: Configure / start generation
    Closed --> Closed: Admit, count matched outcomes, or observe interval expiry
    Closed --> Open: Matched failure and ReadyToTrip returns true
    Open --> Open: Reject if expiry is at or after sampled time
    Open --> HalfOpen: Qualifying call samples strictly after expiry
    HalfOpen --> HalfOpen: Admit below limit, reject at limit, or count subthreshold success
    HalfOpen --> Closed: Matched success meets threshold
    HalfOpen --> Open: Matched failure
    note right of HalfOpen
      Expiry is zero. Admission count saturates.
      Outstanding work lives in callers, separately from breaker state.
    end note
